Subject: Cantor B1 Operator Policy Governance Bundle Verification P0 Solution

@ [solution_uuid] e1cc7b50-cd54-4e15-bb2c-599adbdecaab

& [Solution]
  + implement a pure verifier that first independently replays packet evidence then admits only exact A1 raw bytes
  + validate one closed policy payload and envelope verify detached Ed25519 correspondence and derive a nonauthorizing receipt
  + retain a seven-file fixture-only evidence bundle and a separate verifier that reconstructs every count digest and zero-effect field

& [Safety]
  + never resolve the A1 opaque reference generate a key read time or environment invoke a process provider broker writer or service or promote any authority boolean
